{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "4a9d9a867d80eb55ff9e1f77e2dab836f282e555d36cd16f5e71dd10c792139b", "ja": "きっと全部", "zh": "一定全都是", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "aa6a903612f71591e9d045dab076b87ef697498aef63be67676735588fb5d394", "ja": "真と麗花が司会するヒーローショーを見学\nする事になった環と静香。ショーの勝敗に\n複雑な思いを抱く環に、麗花は「楽しい\nばかりでも楽しくない」と話し、真は「静香\nはもう知ってるんじゃないかな」と言う。", "zh": "环和静香要去观看由真和丽花主持的英雄秀。对于演出的胜负，环怀着复杂的心情，丽花对她说：“光是觉得开心，也不会真的开心。”真则说道：“静香应该已经知道了吧。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "462bd27954bfb6d4059965c050af4685306e374bdb5d1ae7bcc9eecdbb02a1ae", "ja": "（今日は、真と麗花のステージ仕事。ふたりは特撮の\nヒーローショーに、司会として立つ事になっている）", "zh": "（今天是真和丽花的舞台工作。两人要在特摄英雄秀上担任主持人。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "b9de56e08be953c61406c633fd0f1b316de39246542e15a576bf97dc6631dfa4", "ja": "たまき、今日は見学なんだ～！\nまこと、れいか、よろしくね！　くふふ♪", "zh": "环今天是来参观的～！\n真、丽花，请多关照啦！嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "eda0dd7e39faa665454b24198ea295ed814faf235d32b41424d1e9f60abbde85", "ja": "環が、どうしても近くで見たいそうなんだ。\n客席の端の席に入れてもらう事になったから。", "zh": "环说无论如何都想在近处看看。所以就安排她坐到观众席边上的座位了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2423b566e6ae44d4f2fd36282dbe7eaff885a5e268f27cf45c5238d7db13b2df", "ja": "環、よろしくな。今日はお客さんとして、\nふたりとステージを盛り上げてくれ！", "zh": "环，拜托你了。今天就作为客人，和她们两个一起让舞台热闹起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "d450188c18245052e049de3ca1a50f838fb639d0a100d232cc62275909166ab6", "ja": "環がいてくれるなら、心強いね！\n……あれ？　それってもしかして、サクラ……？", "zh": "有环在的话，就让人安心了！\n……咦？那难道是樱花……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "1715fc925381ad6d5cffe794d9e1d66d9534f5c4be3f55e10f6acbe5019a87ce", "ja": "環ちゃんは台本読んでないし、いいんじゃないかな？\nアドリブいっぱいのステージになりそうだね♪", "zh": "环没读剧本，应该没关系吧？\n看来会变成即兴发挥很多的舞台呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "a6a57a4b2fe5f76375dee572c4563675f82e3c8a1d4d2af948c065fbac731d18", "ja": "えっ、それは……\n麗花さん、手加減してくださいね？", "zh": "诶，那可就……丽花姐，请手下留情哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "41b5b45450ac7a5c3b8dc3ba4192dd32bda559b87926012acb91d31c12d25e6f", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\n環はわかりますけど、どうして私まで見学に？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n环也就算了，为什么连我也要来参观呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e1fe6481fc8f63fff5e100931f2b823ed85bd6a23843738ab990e0ef9110b459", "ja": "静香は、まだ悩んでいる様子だったから。\nヒーローの戦いが、何か参考になるかもと思って。", "zh": "因为静香看起来还在烦恼。我想，英雄的战斗或许能给她一些参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a3bbab77011a8e4149594f918dd7a46581e7c976c733f610d8c25bddb3ba3b68", "ja": "ついでに、俺が席を外す時とか\n環を見ていてくれると助かるな！", "zh": "顺便，我离开座位的时候，能帮忙照看一下环就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "c84d76ce24db3f90bc707ab0ce2e70686ce7c7a35555c9c1e42d0e65b8380a27", "ja": "はぁ……理由はそっちですか。まあいいですけど。\n真さん、麗花さん、よろしくお願いします。環もね。", "zh": "唉……原来理由是这个啊。倒也没什么。真、丽花，拜托你们了。环，你也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "625b2f62e589b6231ea4cfb7e301efe2fb63603e4627afc78e8da3402bedd64a", "ja": "うん！　しずかも、\nたまきといっしょにヒーロー応援しようね♪", "zh": "嗯！静香也和环一起为英雄加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "5af780e98d8a68ad444192f57eac9d182e473a330fe950f05e06656a7d27ea07", "ja": "やあ！　お友達のみんな、こんにちはーっ！\nボク、765プロの菊地真って言います！", "zh": "嗨！小朋友们，你们好——！\n我是765事务所的菊地真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "f1988ca071d9fdb76c9fa5b325b676aea969944edc1dcd76040459e6d0a0654f", "ja": "同じく765プロの、北上麗花です。今日は私たち\nふたりで、司会をやらせてもらいますね♪", "zh": "我也是765PRO的北上丽花。今天由我们\n两个人来担任主持哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1016_audience", "source_sha256": "b81661c25435bbcd633bf827faface37775746e38bcf45533a3a923f8af03fcd", "ja": "ザワザワ、ザワザワ……！", "zh": "窸窸窣窣，窸窸窣窣……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "00ab12af882819837f35a221797617adef92e8e84e5980e12ebe1688282e5eb4", "ja": "この後『七桁戦士ミリオンマン』が来てくれるけど、\nその前に幾つか、お姉さんたちと約束してほしいんだ！", "zh": "之后《七位数战士百万侠》会来哦，\n不过在那之前，想先请你答应姐姐们几件事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "f9bd5cdd6e922ad5a3cc9c1220e2cbb3e565ee1ed172aac2cc400c9891b8aee0", "ja": "まず、ステージに近づきすぎないこと。それから会場を\n走り回ったり、椅子の上に立ち上がったりしないこと！", "zh": "首先，不要靠舞台太近。还有不要在会场里\n到处乱跑，也不要站在椅子上哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "717bbbeceab61194c9390f710889288b7caa836c4cd1cd136adee0c7f0391a04", "ja": "お姉さんたちとの約束、守れるよーってお友達は、\n元気にお返事をしてね！　せーのっ？", "zh": "能遵守和大姐姐们的约定——的小朋友们，要精神十足地回答哦！预备——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "02c9e05b1e717c8f196f41df51eb38fe3eea932f516452ba8e2d9c0f32a0e54f", "ja": "は、はーいっ！", "zh": "好、好的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_1022", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2000_audience", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2001_006mak", "source_sha256": "91711f1654a9ebf8ec7efa64e938c3a146fc3cbb952a2ac7ed0462b89d9461ad", "ja": "わぁ♪　いい子たちばっかりで、お姉さんうれしいな！\nそれじゃ、さっそく……って、うわっ！？", "zh": "哇♪ 全都是些好孩子，姐姐真开心！\n那么，马上开始……呃，哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2002_sauzantouin", "source_sha256": "d1852642293c759e8b6dca8d120173dd728d84dd87e8608224387fee07ecbe5d", "ja": "ケタケタケタケタケターッ！", "zh": "嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2003_006mak", "source_sha256": "1ffc065999007f27f6edadb060fd9023216896e28bad7652c8607dd52ea3509d", "ja": "くっ、悪の組織、サウザン党員が！\nう、うぅ……か弱いボクの力じゃ、敵いそうにないや！", "zh": "可恶，邪恶组织的千党成员来了！\n呜、呜呜……凭我这点弱小的力量，好像根本敌不过呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2004_048rei", "source_sha256": "e577f928be8584d824e278f02a82c0f3f55635aabbd23c253248a039bbcd828c", "ja": "大変、真お姉さんがピンチだよ！　みんな、麗花\nお姉さんと一緒に、ミリオンマンを呼んでくれるかな？", "zh": "不好，真姐姐遇到大危机了！大家能和丽花\n姐姐一起呼唤百万侠吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2005_048rei", "source_sha256": "bbbc35b138a1d245d3fab12a99a40c31ac34ca0ebd3678565246c11ae9a5a1d2", "ja": "富士山の向こうまで、届いちゃうくらいの声で！\nせーのっ……ヤッホー！", "zh": "用能传到富士山那一头的声音！\n预备……呀吼——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2006_006mak", "source_sha256": "83b7bdbfbc66847b70dad650c386396af2d7f79fcfaa61f47c13013d2e579714", "ja": "いやいやいや！？　やっほーじゃ来ないよ！\nミリオンマン、助けてーっ！", "zh": "不不不！？　喊“呀吼”他是不会来的啦！\n百万侠，救命啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2008_mirionman", "source_sha256": "c57b6c204eb6296562f385338c3ffbd6ee230dfd52135dd121260e16b568d6d4", "ja": "ハンドレッド……何故だ！？\n元ヒーローのお前が、どうしてサウザン党などに……！", "zh": "汉德雷德……为什么！？  \n你可是曾经的英雄，为什么要加入萨乌赞党这种组织……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2009_hanndoreddo", "source_sha256": "366e5ec3090f3e60dadcdeb1a95165e50c7f142f7a0b2bdfa51edd66c257a3e5", "ja": "言うな、ミリオンマン。この手は既に、血で赤く\n染まっているのだ……さあ抜け、ミリオンソードを！", "zh": "别说了，百万侠。这只手已经被鲜血染得通红……\n来吧，拔出百万之剑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2010_mirionman", "source_sha256": "488b8c9a2b9a73d0f07f921bb5d7dc277df47de437ce1526ba76c16d654629fc", "ja": "勝者にも敗者にも、なりたくはない。だが……\nオレたちはもう、戻れないんだな……ハンドレッド！", "zh": "我不想成为胜者，也不想成为败者。但是……我们已经回不去了啊……一百！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2014_p", "source_sha256": "bd0e11ee5b094bc31846d04f192fa6d74e7b1d46be8c0285a49d67a7d6f6e589", "ja": "真、麗花、お疲れさま！　いい司会ぶりだった！\n客席も凄く盛り上がってたよ。", "zh": "真、丽花，辛苦了！主持得很棒！\n观众席也热闹极了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2015_006mak", "source_sha256": "064cec40ffc0e4c702afa017a3548594cff582e1b8ef8430ac2648ad28283a02", "ja": "へへっ、やーりぃ！　ボクもすっごく楽しかったです！\n静香と環はどうだった？　楽しめた？", "zh": "嘿嘿，太棒啦！我也玩得特别开心！  \n静香和环觉得怎么样？玩得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2016_015siz", "source_sha256": "953e422eb3be523547fee8494a5bb64abf21dafa84fbcb231dc34f043d3d20ec", "ja": "はい！　ちゃんと、大人も楽しめる作りでしたね。\nしっかり引き込まれてしまって……。", "zh": "是的！整体设计得很棒，大人也能乐在其中呢。\n我也完全沉浸进去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2018_048rei", "source_sha256": "4a02da693c99e8b94704fe96eb8eb52bcef2e5b0b61527e52032386450eed6ed", "ja": "あれあれ？　環ちゃん、どうしたの？\n楽しくなかった？", "zh": "咦？环，你怎么了？\n不开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2019_040tam", "source_sha256": "4e9659c01a2981d0b77087965ca64378ca29298a6e250d1b1c0d38d7e0eee088", "ja": "ううん！　すっごく楽しかった！　でも……たまき、\nおやぶんが言ってたこと思い出しちゃった……。", "zh": "没有！超级开心的！可是……环\n想起老大之前说过的话了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2020_p", "source_sha256": "549ee8c500333efceb1f09a238449b77ac62f4153d0b88d4a3cb6e5d17fcab78", "ja": "？　何か言ったか？", "zh": "？我说了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2021_040tam", "source_sha256": "fa57b2c5bf4bdf966f7b4d7ec75e43b846cc016ae8049e41aaf067876d32bac6", "ja": "うん。ヒーローは、みんなを守るために戦うけど……\n戦うって、勝負するってことでしょ？", "zh": "嗯。虽然英雄是为了保护大家而战斗……\n但战斗，就是决胜负的意思对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2022_040tam", "source_sha256": "9ea496d384067f01fbc7c4589e1d4ef355dacce979d6b15071d70f1b8deff7d6", "ja": "誰かが勝つってことは、\n誰かが負けるってことなんだね。", "zh": "有人赢了，也就意味着有人输了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2023_015siz", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2024_040tam", "source_sha256": "72c224c2084b638a3f886802be961b6029f3a3cbe6c683647176214214a5ba01", "ja": "たまき、ハンドレッドも応援してたから……\n複雑だぞ～～……。", "zh": "环也一直在给Hundred加油，所以……心情好复杂啊～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2025_006mak", "source_sha256": "c0566c396acf84c052321ddcc0141d9a42735a86b8815f5c3851ab5149ff9efe", "ja": "そっか……難しいね。ボクは空手をやってたから、\n小さいころからそういう経験があるけど……。", "zh": "这样啊……确实很复杂呢。我以前练过空手道，所以从小就有过类似的经历……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2026_048rei", "source_sha256": "1065c452c51c9646efbb68f0aa41cd945af8627bebb30e24f999572259b4f8e9", "ja": "うんうん。勝負して、勝ち負けを決めるって、\n楽しいことばかりじゃないよね。", "zh": "嗯嗯。进行较量、分出胜负，并不全都是开心的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2027_048rei", "source_sha256": "0465ae02cd29f2adfa7e0667303e8c01d333797b9ea1a5220e9f6b1cbe2f7fe4", "ja": "でも……楽しいことばっかりでも、\n逆に楽しくないんじゃないかな？って、私は思うよ！", "zh": "但是……如果尽是开心的事，反而会不会觉得没意思呢？我是这么想的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2028_040tam", "source_sha256": "9fe26da9e841bac3ee3a2c8259fab07da22cf49bfe271da704288514ae9c8935", "ja": "……？\n勝ってばっかりだと、楽しくないの？", "zh": "……？\n如果总是赢，会不会就没意思了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2029_048rei", "source_sha256": "043a07bb24fea11b9edbe820e79529dbab8704c0beb126106d65123496557c55", "ja": "うん。\n勝ってばっかりっていうか、楽勝ばっかり？", "zh": "嗯。\n与其说是光赢，不如说全都是轻松获胜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2030_048rei", "source_sha256": "cdba1b3f478ae652b513621f3e7a508ef65e33e4e8b5c95efea154e99cb1fa00", "ja": "険しい山を登るときって、苦しいけど。\nその苦しさが楽しいから。そういうことかも？", "zh": "爬险峻的山时，虽然很辛苦。\n但正因为那份辛苦很快乐。或许就是这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2031_p", "source_sha256": "6005c35e02b3919ad7d74e850f90d6a81c0debf7fe0813f044c329c6a86a6a42", "ja": "なるほど。『楽しい』という事と、\n『楽』という事は違う……みたいな意味だな。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，“开心”和“轻松”是两回事……对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2032_040tam", "source_sha256": "a91c5681f0fbc3bf413212f5d0f9c5d20f37f3f64daac67d80d91c275794e305", "ja": "うーん……？　かけっこでがんばって走ると、\n苦しいけど、楽しい……ってこと？", "zh": "嗯……？也就是说，赛跑时努力奔跑虽然很累，但还是很开心……是这个意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2033_048rei", "source_sha256": "12bbe84366bb6d599d71b4a73de68994ac0c040289628c086e6a140c560f134e", "ja": "そうそう！　戦うことも同じで、楽しいことばかりじゃ\nなくても、楽しくはできるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "对对！战斗也是一样，虽然不全是开心的事，但应该也能从中找到乐趣吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2034_048rei", "source_sha256": "0ee016e7c7fb0d6239172c86d9ee926376d99f2fb1a076fc6f929cba082e4462", "ja": "勝っちゃって悪いなーって思ったり、負けちゃって\n悔しいなーって思うことも、きっと全部楽しいんだよ♪", "zh": "赢了会觉得有点不好意思，输了会觉得不甘心，\n但这些肯定全都是快乐的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2035_040tam", "source_sha256": "c07fc2fbcb961fcd65722b255161401a0d3e28e4e1e9f71d0a207a204bed5cf4", "ja": "勝っても負けても、ぜんぶ楽しい……。\nうん、わかった。れいか、ありがとー！", "zh": "不管赢了还是输了，全都很开心……。\n嗯，我明白了。丽花，谢谢你——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2036_p", "source_sha256": "3eaa66d1b9db5a9573cfc43ea2b28c25b59365f286e288c6e2d40f019a982c4d", "ja": "（環は、何か掴めたみたいだな。よかった。\nでも、静香は……）", "zh": "（环好像有所领悟了。太好了。可是，静香她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2038_006mak", "source_sha256": "6f097e6678072913e5a9793e0edd970fb47d0a239784b52fd6a10e8ceb61da84", "ja": "そんなに悩まなくても、静香はもう、\n持ってるんじゃない？　みんなと戦う理由！", "zh": "不用那么烦恼，静香不是已经拥有了吗？和大家一起战斗的理由！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2039_015siz", "source_sha256": "88886fb8f3df46fe213aea6eb1f42b9753a8b53bf1cd63919121b9b683bd823d", "ja": "え……？\n真さん、それって……？", "zh": "诶……？\n真，你说的是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2040_006mak", "source_sha256": "ace753f77c57a5199e69dbdf3f82545f1d544675f4da5caa89ee728aea231073", "ja": "えっと、うーん……負けたくないから頑張れる、\nっていうのかな……えーっと……うぅ～！", "zh": "那个，嗯……该说是因为不想输，所以才能努力吗……呃……呜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2041_006mak", "source_sha256": "96ca420d5bad8de3350596d991a2ad81aea9955181d9197ba09aea67d2adec6c", "ja": "ゴメン！　ボクってこういう時、上手く言えないんだ。\nもう少し考えておくから、ちょっと待ってて！", "zh": "抱歉！我在这种时候就是不太会好好表达。\n我会再想想的，等我一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_04_2042_015siz", "source_sha256": "5353d85bd70f808c00cd879520f801c4823cb017346a2cb78b5b3fb5ee47a1f5", "ja": "あっ……。\nは、はい！　ありがとうございます……！", "zh": "啊……。\n好、好的！谢谢您……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
